# Sample ~/.terminatorrc  (copy to ~/.terminatorrc)
# One option per line: bind <action> <key>
# Run `bind -l` inside Terminator to list every action and its keys.
# A bad line prints a warning when Terminator starts and keeps the default.

bind clear-screen Ctrl+Shift+L
bind delete-word Alt+Backspace
